<title>MEXICO: Gigante net profit narrows.</title>
<headline>Gigante net profit narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper Income	123.47 million	     63.98 million</p>
<p>	Net		  323.31 million	     416.52 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 9.39 bln		 10.29 bln</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Gigante SA de CV.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, (525) 728-9507</p>
